# RADAR — Revenue Acquisition Discovery And Reconnaissance

**RADAR is DDI's unified opportunity mining system. When Dee says "run RADAR" or "what did RADAR find" — this is what she means.**

---

## WHAT RADAR IS

RADAR is the collection of ALL mining, scanning, and scoring scripts that find opportunities for Dee Davis Inc. across government, commercial, enterprise, and healthcare channels. It is NOT one script — it is the entire intelligence pipeline.

**One name. One system. Every opportunity channel.**

---

## RADAR COMPONENTS

### 1. THE BRAIN — Opportunity Scoring
| Script | What It Does |
|---|---|
| `ddi_opportunity_fit.py` | Scores every opportunity against DDI's service lanes (0-100). Keywords + NAICS matching + subcontract/teaming detection. This is the filter — everything runs through it. |

### 2. GOVERNMENT MINING (Federal / State / Local)
| Script | What It Does | Source |
|---|---|---|
| `auto_mine_edwosb_wosb_only.py` | SAM.gov — EDWOSB/WOSB/SB set-aside opportunities | SAM.gov API |
| `mine_sources_sought_presolicitation.py` | Sources sought & presolicitation notices | SAM.gov API |
| `mine_all_sources_sought.py` | Broad sources sought sweep | SAM.gov API |
| `mine_aog_sam.py` | AOG / freight-specific mining (NAICS 488190) | SAM.gov API |
| `mine_usaspending_buyers.py` | USASpending buyer discovery by NAICS | USASpending API |
| `mine_co_contacts.py` | Contracting officer contact extraction | SAM.gov API |
| `mine_prime_contractors.py` | Prime contractor mining (sub opportunities) | SAM.gov / USASpending |
| `mine_real_federal_forecasts.py` | Federal procurement forecasts | Federal sources |
| `federal_forecasts_system.py` | Federal forecast pipeline | Multiple federal sources |

### 3. COMMERCIAL / ENTERPRISE / HEALTHCARE MINING
| Script | What It Does | Source |
|---|---|---|
| `healthcare_mco_scanner.py` | State Medicaid portals (10 states), hospital RFP sites, MCO vendor portals | State agency websites, hospital procurement |
| `instant_markets_scanner.py` | InstantMarkets categories (janitorial, landscape, healthcare, transportation, etc.) | InstantMarkets.com |
| `instant_markets_scraper.py` | InstantMarkets detailed scraping | InstantMarkets.com |
| `public_portal_scanner.py` | Public procurement portal scanning | Multiple portals |

### 4. INTELLIGENCE & ANALYSIS
| Script | What It Does |
|---|---|
| `nexus_opportunity_intelligence.py` | AI scorer + email alerts + Michigan local mining (MichiganLocalMiner) |
| `nexus_opportunity_hunter_api.py` | API endpoints for the opportunity hunter interface |
| `contract_intelligence.py` | Expiring contract intel, prime/sub/recompete analysis |
| `historical_pricing_scraper.py` | USASpending pricing history for competitive benchmarking |
| `pricing_intelligence.py` | Market rate benchmarks + markup recommendations |
| `solicitation_market_research.py` | Deep-dive market research on specific solicitations |

### 5. PARTNER MATCHING
| Component | What It Does |
|---|---|
| `partner-opportunity-mining.mdc` | Maps every opportunity to DDI's 12 fulfillment partners |
| Partner matrix in every RADAR report | Shows which partner fulfills each opportunity found |

