## HOW TO RUN RADAR

### Full Sweep (All Channels)
```bash
cd "/Users/deedavis/NEXUS BACKEND"
export SAM_GOV_API_KEY=$(grep SAM_GOV_API_KEY .env | cut -d= -f2)

# Government mining
python3 auto_mine_edwosb_wosb_only.py
python3 mine_sources_sought_presolicitation.py
python3 mine_aog_sam.py

# Commercial / Healthcare mining
python3 healthcare_mco_scanner.py

# Intelligence scoring
python3 nexus_opportunity_intelligence.py
```

### Quick Scan (Healthcare + MCO only)
```bash
python3 healthcare_mco_scanner.py
```

### Government Only
```bash
python3 auto_mine_edwosb_wosb_only.py
python3 mine_sources_sought_presolicitation.py
```

