## TRIGGER PHRASES — WHAT DEE SAYS AND WHAT TO DO

| Dee Says | What NEXUS Does |
|---|---|
| **"What's on the RADAR"** | Run all RADAR mining scripts → present results organized by partner fulfillment |
| **"Run RADAR"** | Same as above — full sweep |
| **"What did RADAR find"** | Show most recent RADAR results (check output files first, don't re-run unless stale) |
| **"RADAR report"** | Compiled results from all channels, formatted for Dee |
| **"RADAR is down"** | Mining scripts aren't running — troubleshoot scheduler |
| **"Anything on RADAR?"** | Quick summary of recent finds — check output files, present highlights |

**When Dee asks any of these: DO NOT ask clarifying questions. DO NOT explain what RADAR is. Just run it and present results.**

