## INTEGRATION

RADAR feeds into:
- `NEXUS` — Overall command center
- `GPSS` — Government procurement pipeline
- `BID_TRACKER_DASHBOARD.md` — Active bid tracking
- `PARTNER_ACCOUNT_UPDATES.md` — Partner capability matching
- `nexus_scheduler.py` — Automated daily execution
- `NEXUS_WATCH_LIST.md` — Solicitations being monitored

RADAR uses:
- `ddi_opportunity_fit.py` — Scoring brain
- `partner-opportunity-mining.mdc` — Partner matching matrix
- SAM.gov API key from `.env`
- Anthropic API for AI scoring (in `nexus_opportunity_intelligence.py`)

